{
    "word": "getup",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f7c1478b-025e-3b8e-8216-c8964e705c10",
                "word": "getup",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "77542e19-cc14-4f71-bc4f-5a0d0ff4f37a",
                        "entry_id": "f7c1478b-025e-3b8e-8216-c8964e705c10",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "getups"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "457b826d-1a9c-392a-a942-c4f2110f6491",
                        "entry_id": "f7c1478b-025e-3b8e-8216-c8964e705c10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clothes, costume or outfit, especially one that is ostentatious or otherwise unusual."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d415f7c-c48a-41de-9c3a-f61969fecc9b",
                                "sense_id": "457b826d-1a9c-392a-a942-c4f2110f6491",
                                "text": "When near the buildings I met a white man, in such an unexpected elegance of get–up that in the first moment I took him for a sort of vision."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0155e55-80b0-4830-b27d-313470d6952c",
                                "sense_id": "457b826d-1a9c-392a-a942-c4f2110f6491",
                                "text": "The Schnitzelbank Band, each member attired in an odd getup, received many comments for the manner in which the men marched."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f877f910-765a-47d3-9181-eeb200a1b0df",
                                "sense_id": "457b826d-1a9c-392a-a942-c4f2110f6491",
                                "text": "Oh, I forgot. She had on a get-up that took the attention of anyone that saw her, even in that crazy mob. The better to cut the wind, she had shortened sail and wore a short skirt, black tights, and a skullcap."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "656e5607-0875-4f9e-96a8-4edb5bc72a7e",
                                "sense_id": "457b826d-1a9c-392a-a942-c4f2110f6491",
                                "text": "[A] parade of costumed cadets trots by: a shark costume, an Uncle Sam getup and three young men in form-fitting bodysuits."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c349b4c2-9f12-4bc0-b751-f412f681804a",
                                "sense_id": "457b826d-1a9c-392a-a942-c4f2110f6491",
                                "text": "They wore jorts and crop tops; or strappy, S&M-influenced getups; or pajamas emblazoned with cartoons."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "599a7744-1064-3e7a-ad10-ea2f73ad5b5a",
                        "entry_id": "f7c1478b-025e-3b8e-8216-c8964e705c10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fight or altercation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "24e3285d-7224-40da-87f1-9196a9b6f8ad",
                                "sense_id": "599a7744-1064-3e7a-ad10-ea2f73ad5b5a",
                                "text": "\"A bully. Picked on fellows. He loved to fight. But I never saw him in a getup with a fellow his own size.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "947aea5c-737d-3a61-ac38-8309ea24edfc",
                        "entry_id": "f7c1478b-025e-3b8e-8216-c8964e705c10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Layout and production style, as of a magazine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6b42b2e5-3eb2-3854-b182-a8fb41dc3d91",
                        "entry_id": "f7c1478b-025e-3b8e-8216-c8964e705c10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of get-up-and-go."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6859f711-73ba-4dd0-811f-edccb69ece1a",
                        "source_entry_id": "f7c1478b-025e-3b8e-8216-c8964e705c10",
                        "source_sense_description": "outfit",
                        "target_lang_word": "accoutrement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "accoutrement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                        "entry_id": "2c831d2a-4308-3d63-851b-436f60a570ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Habillement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d1c0ac6-911c-4c70-b756-da6b70d17001",
                                                "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                                "text": "Enfin je n'y tins plus, je mis bas pantalon, bottes et chaussettes, je complétai mon accoutrement de pêcheur sur le modèle de celui de Maurice, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "faccbed9-51c5-43fa-8a2e-aef1f9701b69",
                                                "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                                "text": "Des bonnets de fourrure, des ceintures de peau de daim complétaient l'accoutrement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e58f2e7-1dd4-4010-83d4-0d3ebcfa6f32",
                                                "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                                "text": "[…], un accoutrement de voyage qui n’est de bon goût ni dans sa coupe démodée ni dans sa couleur tapageuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f81eeb62-4e80-48e1-9607-44926e41a32a",
                                                "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                                "text": "Pensant à son accoutrement, il se défit de son faux-col et de sa casquette blanche d’aéronaute, qui pouvaient le trahir, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3ee8d15-ad80-46f1-a6f1-81afaa71d132",
                                                "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                                "text": "Où donc était-il passé depuis le temps, car il n’avait assurément pu songer, dans l’accoutrement où il était, à descendre en ville ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "414e670f-beef-3924-8b1c-e4889a598485",
                                        "entry_id": "2c831d2a-4308-3d63-851b-436f60a570ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tenue vestimentaire surprenante."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72497fd9-8d3e-40aa-b087-28d9cf8e3c7e",
                                                "sense_id": "414e670f-beef-3924-8b1c-e4889a598485",
                                                "text": "On lui ordonna d’ôter la belle pelisse dont elle était revêtue, ce qu’elle refusa de faire, et si opiniâtrement que les valets du bourreau furent obligés de l’attacher au poteau dans cet accoutrement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6ab53e62-e3dd-4d06-81ae-0265a46f0f83",
